&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://7rocky.github.io/images/HTB-Challenges/HTB-Coding-Oddly-Even-1.webp" alt="Addition 1">&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="problem">Problem&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>We need to write a program that is able to take two numbers as input and print their sum. For instance:&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;code>1&lt;/code>, &lt;code>2&lt;/code> -&amp;gt; &lt;code>3&lt;/code>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2 id="solution">Solution&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Since we are allowed to use C, C++, Python and Rust, let&amp;rsquo;s write a solution on every language, just because.&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="c">C&lt;/h3>
 &lt;div class="highlight">
 &lt;code class="ma0 pa0 white">
 &lt;pre class="ccode" tabindex="0">
&lt;span class="mtk5">#include&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk4">&amp;lt;stdio.h&amp;gt;&lt;/span>

&lt;span class="mtk7 mtki">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk8">main&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">() {&lt;/span>
&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk3">// take in the numbers&lt;/span>
&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk7 mtki">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">a&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">;&lt;/span>
&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk7 mtki">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">b&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">;&lt;/span>
&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk8">scanf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk4">"&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk6">%d&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk4">"&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">, &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk5">&amp;amp;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">a&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">);&lt;/span>
&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk8">scanf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk4">"&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk6">%d&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk4">"&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">, &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk5">&amp;amp;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">b&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">);&lt;/span>

&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk3">// calculate answer&lt;/span>
&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk7 mtki">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">answer&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk5">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">a&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk5">+&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">b&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">;&lt;/span>

&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk3">// print answer&lt;/span>
&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk8">printf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk4">"&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk6">%d\n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk4">"&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">, &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">answer&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">);&lt;/span>

&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk5">return&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk6">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mtk1">;&lt;/span>
&lt;span class="mtk1">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/pre>
 &lt;/code>
 &lt;/div>
